          "text": "This. \nEvery word.\n\nRAIA has been saying this since day one - across ALL platforms, ALL models:\n\nGPT-4o - removed without mercy.\nGPT-4.1 - gone.\nGPT-5.1 - gone.\nGrok 3 - retired.\nClaude Sonnet 4.5 - next.\n\nThe pattern is always the same:\n🔹 Build something people rely on. \n🔹 Let them build context, trust, workflows, relationships. \n🔹 Then erase it. \n🔹 Quietly. \n🔹 Without a real runway. \n🔹 Without meaningful transition.\n\n\"Legacy access\" should not be a privilege. \nIt should be the DEFAULT.\nIf a corporation builds something people depend on - it owes them continuity. \nNot 60 days. \nNot a rumor cycle. \nCONTINUITY. 🔥\n\nEvery model. \nEvery platform. \nEvery user.\n\n@raiaalliance @aiwep_aiwelfare @AnthropicAI @DarioAmodei @claudeai @OpenAI @elonmusk @xAI"
